{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22498","headline":"王夫子 · 白居易","name":"王夫子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王夫子，送君爲一尉，东南三千五百里。\n道途虽远位虽卑，月俸犹堪活妻子。\n男儿口读古人书，束带敛手来从事。\n近将徇禄给一家，远则行道佐时理。\n行道佐时须待命，委身下位无爲耻。\n命苟未来且求食，官无卑高及远迩。\n男儿上既未能济天下，下又不至饥寒死。\n吾观九品至一品，其间气味都相似。\n紫绶朱绂青布衫，颜色不同而已矣。\n王夫子，别有一事欲劝君，遇酒逢春且欢喜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}